@host = http://localhost:5000

### Simple equality: everyone in Engineering
POST {{host}}/search
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant: acme
X-User: alice

{
  "field": "Department",
  "operator": 0,
  "value": "Engineering"
}

### Nested AND: Engineering AND salary > 100k
POST {{host}}/search
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant: acme
X-User: alice

{
  "logic": 0,
  "filters": [
    { "field": "Department", "operator": 0, "value": "Engineering" },
    { "field": "Salary", "operator": 2, "value": 100000 }
  ]
}

### OR: anyone in Sales OR Finance
POST {{host}}/search
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant: acme
X-User: alice

{
  "logic": 1,
  "filters": [
    { "field": "Department", "operator": 0, "value": "Sales" },
    { "field": "Department", "operator": 0, "value": "Finance" }
  ]
}

### String contains on email domain
POST {{host}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "field": "Email",
  "operator": 10,
  "value": "@acme.io"
}

### Audit trail for today
GET {{host}}/audit

### Cache stats (run /search twice first, then check hits vs misses)
GET {{host}}/cache/stats
